        "original_id": "8adcfa05-46e5-5545-bf6a-77415209ace6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: French Bulldog, American Bulldog\n- People: Brigitte\n- Places: England, Paris, France\n- Organizations: ABC\n- Topics: dog breeds, breed origins, breed types, television roles\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1800s, French Bulldog dogs resulted from a cross between bulldog ancestors imported from England and local ratters in Paris, France.\n- Brigitte was born in 2010.\n- The French Bulldog, also known as the Frenchie, is a small breed of domestic dog.\n- The American Bulldog is a breed of utility dog.\n- American Bulldog dogs have two specific types, Standard and Classic, and also include mixes of those two types.\n- Brigitte is a French Bulldog dog actress best known for playing Stella in the ABC television series \"Modern Family\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
